WEBVTT

00:10:25.228 --> 00:10:31.783
(Applause and cheers)

00:10:31.807 --> 00:10:35.871
We cannot stand by
and let our watchdogs be put down.

00:10:35.895 --> 00:10:39.053
We can't let more communities
vanish into darkness.

00:10:39.355 --> 00:10:42.164
It is time to debate
a public funding option

00:10:42.188 --> 00:10:44.458
before the fourth estate disappears,

00:10:44.482 --> 00:10:47.942
and with it, our grand
democratic experiment.

00:10:47.966 --> 00:10:50.299
We need much more than a rebellion.

00:10:50.323 --> 00:10:53.041
It is time for a revolution.

00:10:53.065 --> 00:10:54.227
Thank you.

00:10:54.251 --> 00:10:58.104
(Applause and cheers)